      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it (Order ID: ORD-0001): sertraline 600 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nI added a note to the order. It says the dose is above the labeled maximum of 200 mg/day, that you confirmed it was intended, and that it needs pharmacy verification. It also lists what to monitor for: serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation, and seizures.\n\nPharmacy will probably call you about this dose. Consider getting a baseline ECG and checking electrolytes, especially potassium and magnesium. Also check for other serotonergic or QT-prolonging drugs on the patient's medication list."
      }
     ],
